    "text": "To determine the number of coconut flavored jelly beans, we need to follow these steps:\n\n1. Calculate the number of red jelly beans.\n2. Determine the number of coconut flavored jelly beans from the red jelly beans.\n\nFirst, we find the number of red jelly beans. Since three fourths of the jelly beans are red, we calculate:\n\\[\n\\text{Number of red jelly beans} = \\frac{3}{4} \\times 4000 = 3000\n\\]\n\nNext, we find the number of coconut flavored jelly beans. Since one quarter of the red jelly beans are coconut flavored, we calculate:\n\\[\n\\text{Number of coconut flavored jelly beans} = \\frac{1}{4} \\times 3000 = 750\n\\]\n\nTherefore, the number of coconut flavored jelly beans is \\(\\boxed{750}\\).",
